1|0@leagueoflegends^1440581412#cug350g:Wafflashizzles$:No, because that truck would get stuck in the exact. same. traffic. The supermassive ping increases from west coasters are because riot has yet to reach new partnership agreements for their new datacenter in Chicago. Anything above 80-90 is not a distance thing, it's an ISP thing- the data for the game is getting entangled with the rest of the traffic, and rerouted to strange places/slowed down. 
